{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "8cf4c27188265e2c727e337e68e3a617214723393331b5529faea28cc23672c7", "ja": "打ち合わせを終えた海美と琴葉。学園祭の\n手作り感に、劇場ができたばかりの頃を思い\n出し、環境が変化した事を実感する。何故\n自分達を指名したのか聞き忘れたふたりは、\n次の打ち合わせで改めて理由を尋ねる。", "zh": "结束讨论的海美和琴叶。学园祭的手作氛围让她们想起剧场刚建成时的情景，也切实感受到环境已经发生了变化。忘了询问为什么会指名她们的两人，准备在下次讨论时再正式问问理由。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_03_1000_null", "source_sha256": "50f1d19cb3624552eb3cb09509f3091859712ac4daa048a1b79cc3459e9f349c", "ja": "打ち合わせ終了後……", "zh": "会议结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_03_1001_p", "source_sha256": "40b079941f60c09143f2e9eb5125516c36c69f43a941036d17c3b0dc577b810c", "ja": "ふたりとも、今日はお疲れ様。\nどうだ、打ち合わせに参加してみた感想は？", "zh": "两位，今天辛苦了。\n参加这次商讨会感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_03_1002_029umi", "source_sha256": "6cb915ec5e4e037577b286812c46060b77491367f84eb9daa8cf9bd81423145b", "ja": "いろいろ話せて楽しかったよ！　\n実行委員のふたりとも、仲良くなれたしねっ♪", "zh": "聊了好多事情，特别开心哦！\n而且跟执行委员的两个人也搞好关系了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_03_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "0ee09c11b50821b2e90f7d0d46e89fa18af95d1773f95e0ccf5489b794c970d6", "ja": "そうだね。それに「学園祭を成功させたい」っていう、\nふたりの気持ちを間近で感じられて……。", "zh": "是啊。而且，我还能近距离感受到你们两个人那份“想让校园祭成功”的心情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_03_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "737b2a34fa615beea6a87ce987d1ecac68b6ffcaa754f2d7f25b23c9db410e94", "ja": "私も、もっとがんばらなくちゃって思いました。\n参加できて、よかったです。", "zh": "我也觉得必须更加努力才行。\n能参加真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_03_1005_p", "source_sha256": "32a253bf7f8dbeb5b8d99b59df795062bba4405f92c1f24a73c53910577c4e65", "ja": "そうか。学生さん達が主催だから、いつもと勝手が\n違うこともあるかもしれないけど、よろしく頼むな。", "zh": "这样啊。因为是学生们主办的，可能会有些地方\n和往常不太一样，就拜托你们了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_03_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "f6799d5d990fd8d32d81f338a2a4c9cf174c8905fab3ca52099545f0c13d0b4c", "ja": "うんうん、まかせて！　なんだか、\n劇場ができたばっかりの頃を思い出すね！", "zh": "嗯嗯，交给我吧！总觉得，想起剧场刚建成那会儿了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_03_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "c60540ee6b6434f8af17be18e2000582c67ec43ed6d7089192aae28fa654a6af", "ja": "会場作りのお手伝いなんて久しぶりだし！\nえへへ、楽しみだな～♪", "zh": "好久没帮忙布置会场了！\n嘿嘿，真期待啊～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_03_1008_017kth", "source_sha256": "c50ee3c72fc683ec9443652e09ecdf867e2c65e3b2892355cd1cc3fe06b79f14", "ja": "最近はこういう機会が、減っていましたよね。\n劇場の公演以外にも、お仕事が増えたから……。", "zh": "最近这样的机会，确实少了不少呢。\n除了剧场的演出之外，工作也增多了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_03_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "56651f724b720f8e4785a1bbc80447832eae2cb39533b6839342d4fcbf50de38", "ja": "だから、私も海美ちゃんと同じ気持ちで……\nちょっとワクワクしてます♪", "zh": "所以，我也和海美一样……\n觉得有点期待呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_03_1010_p", "source_sha256": "62c7d98c886ef3dc5618f1f16fc583770b0a03166c443e518111374028b0105e", "ja": "ふたりが楽しんでくれているなら良かった。\nライブ本番も準備も、よろしく頼むな！", "zh": "两个人能享受其中就好。\n正式演出和准备工作，也拜托你们了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_03_1011_p", "source_sha256": "a5f4838fb0a1e403162069632e6e1904a51a989acb7d46a864d116ed31173515", "ja": "それにしても、劇場ができたばかりの頃、か。\nそれほど前じゃないのに、なんだか懐かしく感じるな。", "zh": "不过，说起来，那还是剧场刚建成不久的时候啊。\n明明没过去多久，却总觉得令人怀念。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_03_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "173af86fb389ac88fac97dac53e3eb2368cc7227e93dc2e882a422610ed04e72", "ja": "うん、あっという間だったよ！\n時間が過ぎるのって早いよね～。", "zh": "嗯，转眼就过去了呢！\n时间过得真快呀～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_03_1013_029umi", "source_sha256": "fc0e17252e11fb1a7233b9207abd1ab459c413e9e617b965c920ae3908cd6489", "ja": "気づいたら、お仕事がどんどん増えて、\n楽しいことも増えていって……。", "zh": "回过神来，工作越来越多，开心的事情也越来越多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_03_1014_017kth", "source_sha256": "6a94781d01910998d6f906521bdb6f29bf45b5c9fbd6e32114baeec8b6090e51", "ja": "うん……先輩たちに比べたら、\nまだまだだなって思うことも多いけど……。", "zh": "嗯……虽然和前辈们比起来，\n我常常觉得自己还差得远就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_03_1015_017kth", "source_sha256": "a36b27629cdb5aad673a310736defb789cd54bac81faf3bfcc7bfb2d54106c68", "ja": "それでも少しずつ、前に進んでる実感はあるかな。\nこうして、指名でのお仕事も来るようになったし。", "zh": "尽管如此，我还是能感觉到自己在一点点向前迈进。\n像这样，也开始有了指名的工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_03_1016_029umi", "source_sha256": "80f81bcc1f1af6306e980878319ab58913b5ad8c1e7d62611fd769185e618e1e", "ja": "そうだね！　……あ！\nそれで思い出した！", "zh": "是啊！……啊！\n这么一来我想起来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_03_1017_029umi", "source_sha256": "8b621b54ce6fad6385c764915c1b7765fd9b08f77d5dc38622e1ed18e768c239", "ja": "どうして私と琴葉を呼んでくれたのか、\n聞くの忘れちゃった……！", "zh": "为什么会叫我和琴叶过来，\n我都忘了问了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_03_1018_017kth", "source_sha256": "68179dd848d1c65abd0e51ff958eb2bced9b8b0d33530c5f0d86196374710a7c", "ja": "そういえば……。\n打ち合わせに夢中で、聞くの忘れてたね。", "zh": "这么说来……  \n我们光顾着商量事情，忘了问呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_03_1019_p", "source_sha256": "620484bb1c97bfd62bb191cf214650cf59e728cdfbc7420ac8b4adebace05d4c", "ja": "すまない、聞きそびれたな。\n『灼熱少女』がきっかけだとは言っていたけど……。", "zh": "抱歉，刚才没听到。虽然你说过是因为『灼热少女』……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_03_1020_p", "source_sha256": "b3793f066fadfaec2420d2aa3ca1068ee3c6ee65ebbdfae3b67fb0783884cbef", "ja": "もし気になるなら、次の打ち合わせで\n聞いてみたらどうだ？", "zh": "要是好奇的话，下次碰头商谈的时候\n去问问看怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_03_1021_029umi", "source_sha256": "ef13369171e3568a7b00d73c28d27a7f5cbf0b2c93b5b71b3205a31ef7eb29d0", "ja": "えっ、またついて行っていいの！？", "zh": "咦，我也可以再一起去吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_03_1022_p", "source_sha256": "d86aa4dfcd2c90302fa363551288ae16e9620c2c83a2e63f51fad1b4e3fafdc0", "ja": "もちろん。それに、ふたりも\n一緒に打ち合わせした方がいいだろ？", "zh": "当然。而且，你们两个也一起去商量一下比较好吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_03_1023_029umi", "source_sha256": "829db5e4c7bcbe40e93e89354f15eb206403b519e2d9a5cd2e03ef5c5a038eb3", "ja": "やったーっ！　絶対行くよーっ！\nねっ、琴葉？", "zh": "太好了——！我一定会去的——！\n对吧，琴叶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_03_1024_017kth", "source_sha256": "dc671de7f394586bd477d5668992197b1bb0808cf427a09d7478911004c2d866", "ja": "うん！　それじゃ、{$P$}。\n次の打ち合わせも、よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "嗯！那么，{$P$}。\n下次的会议也请多多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_03_1025_null", "source_sha256": "6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e", "ja": "数日後……", "zh": "过了几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_03_1026_p", "source_sha256": "5d4b15bfc31feead830b22ca5f121725fdda7adaeb9acf26b9ff3f5a97f3dd7a", "ja": "（今日は学園祭の2回目の打ち合わせ。話し合いは\n順調に進み、いったん休憩を挟む事になった……）", "zh": "（今天是学园祭第2次筹备会议。讨论进行得很顺利，决定先休息一下……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_03_1027_017kth", "source_sha256": "744ed549da45fcc53ec403f76e5ca59c6a41dc4ec43f40b65b31568788acedd6", "ja": "ライブの方向性、固まってきましたね。\nとりあえず、トークパートはさっき話した通りで。", "zh": "演出的方向已经逐渐确定下来了呢。\n总之，谈话环节就按刚才说的来吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_03_1028_p", "source_sha256": "8e073d4572b12b9879b30501186bafc637312d3056f7e00150f039b7f17e98cc", "ja": "ああ、そうしよう。ふたりとも、色々意見ありがとう。\nおかげで予定よりも早く話が進んでるよ。", "zh": "嗯，就这么办吧。两位，谢谢你们提出了各种意见。\n多亏了你们，事情比预定进展得更快。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_03_1029_yuduki", "source_sha256": "24e00f2b3e748c1d7dfdce500184547c47697932e334cb4ac41ef3c1306ed673", "ja": "はい、本当にありがとうございます！　まさか、\nまた来てもらえるなんて思っていませんでした！", "zh": "是的，真的非常感谢您！没想到您还会再来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_03_1030_sakuna", "source_sha256": "e1e1a5444e5496064d76ab9934e7a69d5166509b4479c1ec5380133c0109215e", "ja": "普通、こんなに何度も参加してくれるものなんですか？\nアイドルの方とお仕事するのは初めてなので……。", "zh": "通常情况下，真的会有人参加这么多次吗？\n因为这是我第一次和偶像合作……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_03_1031_017kth", "source_sha256": "c620c35a1ca9cc35e9c640ac6251bc7ae00d27fe4793e770ac16db5c7446c9c2", "ja": "どうかな……。先輩たちみたいに忙しいと、\nなかなか毎回ってわけにはいかないと思うけど……。", "zh": "这个嘛……如果像前辈们那样忙的话，应该很难每次都参加吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_03_1032_029umi", "source_sha256": "1c13ca9899887cb5abff01707b80898befb3d0c7f79d76c4d5dadba5c3ead32b", "ja": "うんうん。私たちはまだ、お仕事いっぱいで大忙し！\nって感じじゃないもんね。", "zh": "嗯嗯。我们现在还没到工作多得忙不过来的程度嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_03_1033_029umi", "source_sha256": "70427fe09f04c74b862628a5e80752545631f061fa919f772245566eae808815", "ja": "だからもっともっとがんばって、\n早く売れっ子にならないと！", "zh": "所以要更加努力，早点成为当红偶像才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_03_1034_017kth", "source_sha256": "9302cc27a0284a84a82f8c1b8b2edc8817a57d0ac243a4d196c6b319bf850899", "ja": "あ、でも……。もし忙しくなったら、こんなふうに、\n打ち合わせには来られなくなっちゃうかも……？", "zh": "啊，不过……要是变得忙起来了，可能就没办法像这样来参加商谈了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_03_1035_029umi", "source_sha256": "b749f3cea462756dda2f7600ca7140dc5b588312cc78320b5ddfd3e7210a67d1", "ja": "あっ！　そ、そうかも！？\nど、どうしよう～！", "zh": "啊！好像、好像真的会那样！？\n怎、怎么办才好啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_03_1036_p", "source_sha256": "3a56e650a4806e1c5ebb17a7bd6f73fa932dc15f64057c0bbe2afaad343fa352", "ja": "そうなるくらい、売れっ子になってもらわないとな！\nそれより海美、質問があるんじゃなかったか？", "zh": "得让你红到这种程度才行啊！\n话说回来，海美，你不是有问题想问吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_03_1037_029umi", "source_sha256": "f9182120b16df1842016380b2c3139f72c32c0f5efd8126d50c41bd4743c211d", "ja": "え？　あっ、そうだった！\nあのね、私、ふたりに聞きたいことがあるんだ！", "zh": "咦？啊，对哦！\n那个，我有件事想问你们两个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_03_1038_029umi", "source_sha256": "de5a92d5fe3f3faf342cabd07cb257e173f59453758680288ed9b699a21cca32", "ja": "今回、どうして私たちを選んでくれたの？\n先輩とか、他のアイドルの子じゃなくて！", "zh": "这次为什么会选我们啊？\n而不是选前辈，或是其他偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
